  "notes": [
    "The master, English guide and 16 standard plug-ins match the XPK user release. HFMN, MASH, RAKE and SQSH use its base builds.",
    "The Crunch-Mania archive supplies CRM2 and CRMS. The BetterWB Bonus disk ZIP supplies the exact seven other plug-ins.",
    "This package owns the shared Libs/compressors drawer. The Lh, XFD, shared English help and future Crunch-Mania command ownership are separate.",
    "The stock bundle includes neither the upstream shell tools nor the guide icon."
  ],
